{
    "title": "Vanishing Hour - Watch Face",
    "description": "<i><font color=\"#987FFC\">Developed with <b>Watch Face Format</b></font></i>\r\n\r\nVanishing Hour is a Wear OS watch face produced in an official collaboration between Layton Diament and Luka Kilic. It features a centered view of the current hour, which \u201cvanishes\u201d as the minute hand moves forward. The concept is a bold, elegant hybrid of a digital and analog clock \u2014 and serves as a subtle reminder of how quickly time passes.\r\n\r\nThe original design was a finalist in a contest for the Moto 360 watch in 2014. You can read more about it at: https://www.diament.co/post/vanishing-hour-watch-face\r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"#1CB173\">CUSTOMIZATION</font></b>\r\n- \ud83c\udfa8  Color Themes (10x)\r\n- \ud83d\udd70  Vanish Styles (3x)\r\n- \ud83d\udd53  Hand Styles (2x)\r\n- \u26ab  Grey/Black Background\r\n- \ud83d\udd27  Customizable Complication (1x)\r\n- \u231b  12/24H Format (On/Off)\r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"#1CB173\">FEATURES</font></b>\r\n- \ud83d\udd0b  Battery Efficient\r\n- \ud83d\udd8b\ufe0f  Unique Design\r\n- \u231a  AOD Support\r\n- \ud83d\udcf7  High Resolution\r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"#EF930A\">COMPANION APP</font></b>\r\n\r\nThe phone app is there to help you with the installation and setting up the watch face on your smartwatch. Optionally, you can activate notifications to stay informed about updates, campaigns, and new watch faces. \r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"#EF930A\">CONTACT</font></b>\r\n\r\nPlease send any issue reports or help requests to:\r\n\r\ndesigns.watchface@gmail.com\r\n\r\n\r\n<i>Vanishing Hour by Layton Diament and Luka Kilic</i>",
    "descriptionHTML": "<i><font color=\"#987FFC\">Developed with <b>Watch Face Format</b></font></i><br><br>Vanishing Hour is a Wear OS watch face produced in an official collaboration between Layton Diament and Luka Kilic. It features a centered view of the current hour, which \u201cvanishes\u201d as the minute hand moves forward. The concept is a bold, elegant hybrid of a digital and analog clock \u2014 and serves as a subtle reminder of how quickly time passes.<br><br>The original design was a finalist in a contest for the Moto 360 watch in 2014. You can read more about it at: https://www.diament.co/post/vanishing-hour-watch-face<br><br><b><font color=\"#1CB173\">CUSTOMIZATION</font></b><br>- \ud83c\udfa8  Color Themes (10x)<br>- \ud83d\udd70  Vanish Styles (3x)<br>- \ud83d\udd53  Hand Styles (2x)<br>- \u26ab  Grey/Black Background<br>- \ud83d\udd27  Customizable Complication (1x)<br>- \u231b  12/24H Format (On/Off)<br><br><b><font color=\"#1CB173\">FEATURES</font></b><br>- \ud83d\udd0b  Battery Efficient<br>- \ud83d\udd8b\ufe0f  Unique Design<br>- \u231a  AOD Support<br>- \ud83d\udcf7  High Resolution<br><br><b><font color=\"#EF930A\">COMPANION APP</font></b><br><br>The phone app is there to help you with the installation and setting up the watch face on your smartwatch. Optionally, you can activate notifications to stay informed about updates, campaigns, and new watch faces. <br><br><b><font color=\"#EF930A\">CONTACT</font></b><br><br>Please send any issue reports or help requests to:<br><br>designs.watchface@gmail.com<br><br><br><i>Vanishing Hour by Layton Diament and Luka Kilic</i>",
